{
  "identity_key": "2949549127b92e5d1a07ea08a6b731e1c39e1ed9d64d68706d2b1b6f2768b602",
  "identity": {
    "manifest_id": "cc529b1af5b0842aa052199ffcd93b9cc5151a10af63bd7709ec78b3483fd6e1",
    "kind": "a",
    "rows": [
      {
        "id": "A001",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "[over/]你说我干啥[/over]？我是操作员，我是都按流程做的，放心吧，没事儿。",
        "audio": "audio/a_001.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "9dd841b4a191174d50ba6a8ef0fe78e78e16ca486eafa071659f6ef7fa29c218",
        "speaker_id": "13"
      },
      {
        "id": "A002",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "transcript": "我第一天吃完晚上就开始晕。我吃完之后我就，我那个晚上睡觉的时候就天旋地转，我感觉像喝酒了。",
        "audio": "audio/a_002.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "a2f6479360ef777325e69a04222b7ce7f470ec491e668f8091b03aacde903c82",
        "speaker_id": "21"
      },
      {
        "id": "A003",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "我是你爸我不能看吗？我问你是不是谈恋爱了？",
        "audio": "audio/a_003.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "748a1216aa01f17ef08d195f912beaa9781cc79cceeee43eb50a4bb4f14c275c",
        "speaker_id": "13"
      },
      {
        "id": "A004",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "你去告，哎，我公司开十年我还怕人告，你去告，你去告吧！",
        "audio": "audio/a_004.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "00bec6a48be6af5a0ff3d3b9a5034698eccba7f9e10c9459f4cb57c19f45655e",
        "speaker_id": "21"
      },
      {
        "id": "A005",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "transcript": "哎女儿，你是爸爸的掌心的宝贝，[over/]其实[/over]，唉，不说了。",
        "audio": "audio/a_005.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "b0b6d6e9e8ce8d015e221fb405745e76f1157770cd98f926e0e4c92362355975",
        "speaker_id": "13"
      },
      {
        "id": "A006",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "凭什么百分之五十，那这样，那你别干了，好吧，我有权利让你别干了，咱也不争了，就这样。",
        "audio": "audio/a_006.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "f01019f868a2c19bdcca9b21532c5f89b810787a455847eda4500446802fd329",
        "speaker_id": "21"
      },
      {
        "id": "A007",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "transcript": "傻丫头，刚结婚，等你有时间了，好不好？有时间回来看看爸。",
        "audio": "audio/a_007.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "78a3573cd9d61afda09bbda1e332d1d2e5c10ebedab13e2c3cc9b1dbef9c6dda",
        "speaker_id": "13"
      },
      {
        "id": "A008",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "transcript": "那是留给你的钱，密码是你的生日，不要再给我花钱了，这个病也治不好。",
        "audio": "audio/a_008.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "688a29c4d8648348827afcfad5d891e0dcfc6d03e7872737a7f6eac626634ee7",
        "speaker_id": "21"
      },
      {
        "id": "A009",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "transcript": "嗯，没有人可以说啊。我给家里说吧，家里只能说调整状态，你可以的。",
        "audio": "audio/a_009.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "f2fa59c1da3b06eb2fc0044709d1084f815742071b688484764f5028c94a4ef2",
        "speaker_id": "21"
      },
      {
        "id": "A010",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "哦，习惯了，[laughing]不好意思。我那个什么，我有三个上市公司的，平时这个见很多年轻人，主要就是在面试的情况下。没关系，你也不用有太大的压力啊。",
        "audio": "audio/a_010.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "6442c126386d6712a207f336c6d984d1f97780ee0def83b88136e41c32a88870",
        "speaker_id": "21"
      },
      {
        "id": "A011",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "你那狗刚，你那狗刚刚差点就咬到我了，你装看不见是吧？",
        "audio": "audio/a_011.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "670a86f843b2b8226e23ed841946b9d091308450f7f8a8b8ccbe88ecb199b32c",
        "speaker_id": "20"
      },
      {
        "id": "A012",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "还得咱俩配合啊！就你那手艺，你手艺活儿多好啊！人家客户直接看上了。我这一谈，哎没跑儿了，就咱俩啦。就咱俩这生意爆。",
        "audio": "audio/a_012.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "7d940c443ccdc3d9801e2e0e7644ea1eb22085df07cdb14cff60e30e81457b2e",
        "speaker_id": "02"
      },
      {
        "id": "A013",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "行，到时候帮我多推荐几个其他的朋友啊。[over/]到[/over]时候推荐我还能，给您再送点其他的服务。",
        "audio": "audio/a_013.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "3cafcc235f4b36c2f917061e7986f8c84b84451ddb6897d114487c14d1a689aa",
        "speaker_id": "02"
      },
      {
        "id": "A014",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "他们改抽改投别的赛道了，他们觉得在这个赛道里面[laughing]，他们找不到油水，你说说我们现在没有竞争对手啦！",
        "audio": "audio/a_014.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "8bf0183966129f3d9a10f35362fb70c6b6c6c090a05d98225c435d2397fb9a0c",
        "speaker_id": "21"
      },
      {
        "id": "A015",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "那我，我跟你兰兰，兰兰阿姨你以后叫阿姨，啊，叫[over]阿姨[over]。",
        "audio": "audio/a_015.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "ea10cc1337deab38a9ae020935312f434c5c96af87a2e9eee37901f8a9f3c7ef",
        "speaker_id": "13"
      },
      {
        "id": "A016",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "不是，厂长我们不能这样，我们真的不能这样。他是建厂元老，所有的事情都是他一把手，一手做起来的，怎么可以现在我们好起来，就忘了他了呢？",
        "audio": "audio/a_016.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "0cb72cc0dacea86806cd617e1ec4992f347af0451bca9b46b8cee5bb161cf8ea",
        "speaker_id": "20"
      },
      {
        "id": "A018",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "交给我。那这样的话，明天呢，我们就嗯中午先去吃烤鱼，然后下午去逛街，对吗？那晚上我们去干什么呀？",
        "audio": "audio/a_018.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "ea52a8b30211939adf9542f5150f3a8d4993613aec498c752517276db4db6ff9",
        "speaker_id": "20"
      },
      {
        "id": "A020",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "transcript": "哎，你，你觉得行吗？你你你自己能受得了吗？我跟小红一样大，然后我叫她妈，你不难受吗？",
        "audio": "audio/a_020.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "604cb33d55db7f8db94324a60569a7f8c7f58056fee8237007365e479f54fa19",
        "speaker_id": "02"
      },
      {
        "id": "A021",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "transcript": "我很小时候妈妈就走了，就剩你一个了，没有人再陪我过生日了，为什么你就不能陪陪我呢？[over/]每[/over]一年都[over/]这样[/over]。",
        "audio": "audio/a_021.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "7307bd34c0cdc5761e6e2f3ce86422303a18dc568cf57287221b4ef3f2106238",
        "speaker_id": "02"
      },
      {
        "id": "A022",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "transcript": "你们为什么之前不跟我说这些呢？为什么不跟我说这些呢？我不想跟你，我也不想跟我妈，我现在只想跟你们俩一起过日子，我想要我们一家三口，我不想少一个爸爸或者少一个妈妈。",
        "audio": "audio/a_022.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "aa69a511c838f91db2c0c8a8776b4f2d09e3e220ac7ee3f9ee19666a29533689",
        "speaker_id": "02"
      },
      {
        "id": "A023",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "transcript": "[crying]她不肯见我，[crying]她让我出去。",
        "audio": "audio/a_023.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "d23805279c5ffebae72a5f67137c42a35bd5d581f531bed7204618a0e26f57a5",
        "speaker_id": "20"
      },
      {
        "id": "A024",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "[over/]哎呀[over/]，可不，不枉我们小组日日夜夜的，哎，呕心沥血呀！",
        "audio": "audio/a_024.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "f18bc479532395a758d603f893d7b66061d68ace0bfe310c08f372f2c4697717",
        "speaker_id": "20"
      },
      {
        "id": "A028",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "transcript": "我小时候总盼着长大，现在真的长大了，总觉得又不是那么回事儿。我感觉这好像不是我想要的长大的样子。",
        "audio": "audio/a_028.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "d828945a316041836be5957169a258941ff880ee9b277765d0cda0be66f6714c",
        "speaker_id": "20"
      },
      {
        "id": "A029",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "哎，如如直接啊现在安全绳都给你准备好了。在这儿闭上眼睛直接往下跳，特别刺激我都玩了好[over/]多次了啊[/over]。",
        "audio": "audio/a_029.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "23cb6426d6230fcaf2c703337b328972341e6dc51165d476f7ff1757bb39f334",
        "speaker_id": "13"
      },
      {
        "id": "A030",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "transcript": "爸先在客厅等你们，你们先好好化化妆。一会儿，我们的女婿就来接你了好不好？",
        "audio": "audio/a_030.wav",
        "audio_sha256": "3a842a733a6b25f3daf0e122120a65ebd61350deff07f14d79e7e2ffa3920b0d",
        "speaker_id": "13"
      }
    ],
